# Before Quagmire a Swamp prevents blocking Plague Beetle; afterward it may be blocked, retains swampwalk, and islandwalk still prevents a block (CR 702.14b, 609.4).
[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Plague Beetle
Mox Sapphire
Grayscaled Gharial
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Quagmire
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Island
Ornithopter x2
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Plague Beetle.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Grayscaled Gharial.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Plague Beetle > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Plague Beetle)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 19
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
